:: day-2_sleep_transition [nobr]
<<day1Init>>
<<set $energy to 80>>
<<set $stress += 5>>

<div class="day-transition">
  <h2>Night passes. You don't sleep until the hour before dawn.</h2>
  <p class="transition-morning">In that single hour, you dream of water   a deep, warm pool, and you're sinking into it, and it's closing over your head, and you can't tell if you're drowning or being born.</p>
  [[Dawn breaks. → |day-1_hub]]
</div>
